FEED V0 takes the oath as a dwarf knight (down from the hill mines; sees in the dark). Stout, shielded. Hard to kill, slow to finish a fight.
FEED V1 takes the oath as an elf mage (out of the old woods past the fields; sees in the dark). Hits hardest. Dies hardest.
FEED V2 takes the oath as a human cleric (valley-born, like most of Bellmire). Keeps the party upright longer than it deserves.
FEED V3 takes the oath as an orc barbarian (came over the west road and stayed; sees in the dark). The most meat. Swings heavy, guards nothing.
